<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAY 28.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAY 28.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	May 28	May 27   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  272.220     271.610     247.020   10.20 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  311.950     311.900     306.830    1.67 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  160.135     160.100     158.970    0.73 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   47.426	47.400	47.182    0.52 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  445.980     444.000     419.180    6.39 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  142.385     142.340     141.685    0.49 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.234	16.231	16.185    0.30 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  235.290     233.910     212.430   10.76 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.896	 1.900	 1.888    0.42 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.589	 1.586	 1.581    0.51 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  191.930     191.905     183.135    4.80 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
